orgettable New York City experience.</field></shadow></value><next><block type="game_show_long_text" id="68v[jF++nB5UAeeqa!aE"><field name="layout">DialogLayout.Center</field><value name="str"><shadow type="text" id="JL{!7sce2Q^moyX}c0S%"><field name="TEXT">Your goal is to collect all the billboard fragments to assemble the billboard!</field></shadow></value><next><block type="game_show_long_text" id="xPSK2--J{r;fAS~vl3/k"><field name="layout">DialogLayout.Bottom</field><value name="str"><shadow type="text" id="xI1$MQ#T=InHTkEHHJ+M"><field name="TEXT">Good luck!</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block><block type="function_definition" id="Typ?OJ2Gp5R/GnQbt3O," x="3601" y="6517"><mutation name="China" functionid="i!#tuU,tSm_Q|JanxnRn"></mutation><field name="function_name">China</field><statement name="STACK"><block type="colorStartFadeFromCurrent" id="S1C@L1w,!u8[nv,@$1+M"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" _expanded="1" _input_init="true"></mutation><field name="end">color.originalPalette</field><value name="duration"><shadow type="timePicker" id="vYHN5om4*yKWWsX.(KA-"><field name="ms">2000</field></shadow></value><next><block type="hudsetScore" id="y40]jEF3Tx}_vdFr}DQV"><value name="value"><shadow type="math_number" id="67}lZ/u9*mGfNG9zhx6J"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="hudSetLife" id="r7YAvX-fmcu-njMHj:n~"><value name="value"><shadow type="math_number" id="#79~IqIonP;xJuvG1VCI"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value><next><block type="game_show_long_text" id="B#o]1eCez,e-8PE@w@bZ"><field name="layout">DialogLayout.Bottom</field><value name="str"><shadow type="text" id=".p~uDualxv%O:Sl:W[$I"><field name="TEXT">China is a East Asian country with many distinct cultural practices </fi